OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fnight with outbreaks of light rain
OL,7,Fpossible. Heavy rain spreads east into
OL,8,Fwestern Aberdeenshire through the
OL,9,Fearly hours. Brisk southeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds, perhaps strong with risk of
OL,11,Fcoastal gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,14,Fspreading eastwards and clearing
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. This leaves a
OL,16,Flargely dry afternoon with long sunny
OL,17,Fspells developing. Strong winds
OL,18,Fgenerally easing through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
