OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMostly dry with sunny spells on
OL,7,FThursday. Cloudy and breezy start
OL,8,FFriday with rain clearing to bright
OL,9,Fspells and showers. Dry with sunny
OL,10,Fspells on Saturday.
